---
description: Alembic migration rules
globs: tourism-backend/alembic/**/*
alwaysApply: false
---

# Migrations

- New schema changes get an Alembic revision with upgrade and downgrade.
- Do not edit applied migrations that are already on shared main without a follow-up revision.
- Keep PostGIS types explicit; test `alembic upgrade head` against Compose when possible.
- No business logic in migrations.
